        "original_id": "933ea16c-2b04-5045-bb3c-ab59156f8bd6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vladimir Kozlov, Santino Marella, Anthony Carelli, Kyriakos Georgiou, Jaimal Patel, James Baker\n- Organizations: WWE, Sportsnet\n- Roles: professional wrestler, mixed martial artist, sports analyst, trainer, entrepreneur, actor\n- Products: WWE Tag Team Championship, Criminals Game, Criminals Game II, Duality\n\nFacts:\n- Vladimir Kozlov is best known for his time in WWE, where he won the WWE Tag Team Championship once with Santino Marella.\n- Anthony Carelli was born on March 14, 1974, and he is a Canadian sports analyst, trainer, entrepreneur, actor, retired professional wrestler, and retired mixed martial artist.\n- Anthony Carelli currently works for the Canadian sports TV network Sportsnet.\n- Kyriakos Georgiou is best known for playing the role of Vladimir Kozlov in the films Criminals Game and Criminals Game II.\n- Kyriakos Georgiou also starred as James Baker in the film Duality, which was written and directed by Jaimal Patel.",
